{"id":"n70778-1-2","stage":0,"title":"일곱 · 七","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70778-1-2-1","ko":"할아버지, 연세가 어떻게 되세요?","zh":"爷爷，您多大年纪了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지,","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷。","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}},{"text":"연세가","meaning":"年纪（敬语）","explanation":"연세：年龄的敬语，用来礼貌地询问长辈的年纪；-가 标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연세","audio":"/audio/fc2837075a9efa4e8f57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14018","senseId":"1","lemma":"연세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연세가","audio":"/audio/2ffe8e2c201e645f9e1e.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"되세요?","meaning":"是、为（询问年龄）","explanation":"되다：是、为（询问年龄）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되세요","audio":"/audio/d607485c0b9928bd7ea1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"fc2837075a9efa4e","term":"연세","zh":"年纪（敬语）","audio":"/audio/fc2837075a9efa4e8f57.mp3","entryId":"14018","definition":"对他人年龄的尊称。","pronunciation":["연세"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境